# Python Port Plan — 01 · Struct Skeleton

## Goal

Port only the **new Step 1 changes** from `week1_baseline/ruby/01_struct_skeleton`
into `week1_baseline/python/01_struct_skeleton`. The Python Step 0 port has
already been copied into the Step 1 directory, so it is the existing baseline
and is not part of this porting work. Add the three lightweight data
structures introduced by the Ruby step:

- `boukensha.Tool` — a registered callable the agent may use.
- `boukensha.Message` — one conversation entry.
- `boukensha.Context` — all state needed for a future API call.

This step is deliberately structural. It must not add an LLM client, execute
tools, add token accounting, or introduce a test framework.

